# Large static files stored in Vercel Blob (not in Git)
# These files are uploaded to Blob storage and referenced via blob-mapping.json
# Exclude question files (PDFs, PNGs, etc.) but keep manifest/index JSON files
public/Questions/**/*.pdf
public/Questions/**/*.png
public/Questions/**/*.jpg
public/Questions/**/*.jpeg
public/Questions/**/*.gif
public/Questions/**/*.webp
# Ignore topical question assets as well since they are served from R2
public/topicals/
public/topicals/**
supabase
# Optionally exclude documents folder if it's also too large:
# public/documents/**/*.pdf
# public/documents/**/*.png
public/Questions.zip
*.zip
Learnmates.git/
